WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.548
Indefinite pronouns such as someone, anybody, everyone and nothing refer without

00:00:04.548 --> 00:00:06.920
naming a precise person or thing.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:11.047
Which word is an indefinite pronoun? Answer: someone

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:16.069
Write five meaningful sentences using different indefinite pronouns.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.574
Someone refers to an unspecified person.
